<title>UK: Four EU green rates to devalue on Tuesday - HGCA.</title>
<headline>Four EU green rates to devalue on Tuesday - HGCA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The green rates of the Belgian franc, German mark, Dutch guilder and Austrian schilling will be devalued on Tuesday, the Home Grown Cereals Authority (HGCA) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The rates are used by the European Union (EU) to convert Ecu into the currencies of its member states in its Common Agricultural Policy.</p>
</text>
